      "Text": "Security update for speex",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for speex fixes the following issue:\n\n- CVE-2026-116741: out-of-bounds write in `speex_bits_read_whole_bytes()` allows attackers to stream crafted Speex data\n  to corrupt heap or stack memory and crash applications (bsc#1288101).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
